TripCraft Multi-Agent Travel Planner

Current maintainer: 姜兴林 (jiangxing456)
Project: https://github.com/jiangxing456/tripcraft-ai

Early travel-planning example and portions of the frontend originated from:
awesome-llm-apps
https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps/tree/main/advanced_ai_agents/multi_agent_apps/agent_teams/ai_travel_planner_agent_team

This version replaces the original Agent orchestration with LangGraph/LangChain,
adds MCP tools, deterministic budget checks, bounded hotel replanning,
PostgreSQL checkpoints, human confirmation, SSE, preference persistence,
Redis search caching, access checks, tests and Windows start/stop scripts.

The upstream Apache License 2.0 text is retained in LICENSE.
